# M6 (slice 344; the author 2026-11-09: «_только_ f(3) или f(): 3 или f(): / . 3 / end: f»): the call mark of every form
# is the application [(), frame] of the clean graph, applied once by the interpreter and by both emitted codes -- the
# compact call, its layout `f(): args` as a statement, a value and an actual, and its block `f():` ... `end: f`, at the
# root and in a body. a counts its calls: 2 at the root, 3 in values, 3 in body.
fn: a (int: x) int (int: calls 0)
    calls: calls + 1
    return: x + 1
end: a
fn: mytest (int: v) int
    return: v + 30
end: mytest
fn: body () int
    a(): 1
    a():
        2
    end: a
    int: r a(): 3
    return: r
end: body
a(): 4
a():
    5
end: a
int: compact a(6)
int: layout a(): 7
int: actual mytest(a(): 8)
int: inner body()
int: calls a\var\calls
